# Google Workspace SMTP (use an App Password for the Workspace account)
GSUITE_USER=contact@yourdomain.com
GSUITE_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
CONTACT_TO=team@yourdomain.com
# Comma-separated quote symbols (default: ASX + US). Live prices need a provider that covers them; demo values otherwise.
